It&#x27;s a static site that renders the youtube thumbnail + a red play button. When you click on it, it loads the youtube iframe. So it&#x27;s basically deferring the cookie consent and all.<p>We implemented it as a drop-in replacement:<p><pre><code>  -- &lt;iframe src=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.youtube.com&#x2F;embed&#x2F;aqz-KE-bpKQ&quot;&gt;
  ++ &lt;iframe src=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.embedlite.com&#x2F;embed&#x2F;aqz-KE-bpKQ&quot;&gt;

</code></pre>
Nothing else needed.

for an introduction to the CAD software, Kicad, which this project uses, I really liked &quot;Shine on you crazy Kicad&quot;:
